---
title: Home
cssInclude: [ '/css/index.css' ]
---

<h1 id="title">Circadienne</h1>

<p>This is the place I go to when I’m procrasting on something. Here are the things you can find on this website:</p>

<section class="post-thumb-index">
    {% macro samples(collection) %}
        {% set maxSamples = 3 %}
        <ul class="post-thumb-list">
            {% set items2 = collections[collection] | reverse | slice(maxSamples) %}
            {% for items in items2 %}
                {% for item in items %}
                    {{ item | postThumbnail | safe }}
                {% endfor %}
            {% endfor %}
            {% if items2 | length > maxSamples %}
                <li><a href="/{{ collection }}/">More...</a></li>
            {% endif %}
        </ul>
    {% endmacro %}

    <div>
        <h1>Blog</h1>
        {{ samples("blog") }}
    </div>

    <div>
        <h1>Writing</h1>
        {{ samples("writing") }}
    </div>

    <div>
        <h1>Projects</h1>
        {{ samples("project") }}
    </div>
</section>

<p>If you want to know more about this website, go to <a href="/about/">the about page.</a> In the <a href="/links/"><em>Links</em></a> section you will find a list of websites I like.</p>
